'''Pumpcat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Halloween Party!##02 Sugar Struggle|#02 Sugar Struggle]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] grants [[Strong Against|Strong]] against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies and [[Behemoth Slayer]].

