==Trivia==
*When paired with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], the latter appears to wear the pumpkin mask when the two of them are aligned.
*"Abura Cadaver" is a pun on ''abracadabra'' (a stereotypical spell used by "magicians") and ''cadaver'' (a synonym for corpse).
*Harbinger Cat's Japanese name, Shinigami Cat, refers to ''[[wikipedia:Shinigami|shinigami]]'' (''[[wikipedia:Kami|kami]]'' of death), the Japanese equivalent of the Grim Reaper.
*Pumpcat's description misspells the word "mischievous" as "mischevious".
*The spell in Harbinger Cat's Japanese description, "Ajara ka mokuren tekerettsu no pa", is taught by and used to dispel shinigami in the story "[https://youtu.be/P4PCds4tlT4 Shinigami]", one of the most famous ''[[wikipedia:Rakugo|rakugo]]'' stories.
*The small [[The Face|Face]] that drops down on enemies during Harbinger Cat's attack animation may be a reference to [https://yokai.com/tsurubeotoshi/ tsurube otoshi], a giant head ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'' that drops down on its prey from treetops.

